This repository is a throughline standard: a graph of declarations, not a
program. It states the model a GOV.UK form is specified in, so form specs can be
checked against GDS guidance with throughline.

The rules it declares are drawn from the GOV.UK Design System and the GOV.UK
Service Manual, produced by the Government Digital Service. That guidance content
is © Crown copyright and is published under the Open Government Licence v3.0
(https://www.nationalarchives.gov.uk/doc/open-government-licence/version/3/). The
guidance paraphrased in this repository's rationales and in guidance/AUTHORING.md
remains Crown copyright; this repository claims no ownership over it and
reproduces it for interoperability. See https://design-system.service.gov.uk/ for
the authoritative source.
